$$
This is the minimum of the relative potential, so it is a <stable equilibrium in Lagrangian mechanics>[stable relative equilibrium].

Let $q_j=q_j^{(0)}+x_j$ near an equally spaced configuration, and put
$$
A=V_0e^{-4\pi/3}.
