c_k(A^k)_{v_0v_k}=0,
$$
a contradiction. Every coefficient is therefore zero, proving the <linear independence of adjacency powers up to the diameter>:
$$
\boxed{I,A,A^2,\ldots,A^{d(G)}\ \text{are linearly independent}.}
$$

