$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathbb E[X_n\mid\mathcal F_{n-1}]
&=X_{n-1}+A_n\mathbb E[M_n-M_{n-1}\mid\mathcal F_{n-1}]\\
&=X_{n-1}.
\end{aligned}
$$
The assumed integrability therefore proves that $X$ is the <martingale transform> of $M$ by $A$ and is a martingale.

