$$
\boxed{
(a,b)=
\begin{cases}
(-4E,4E),&0\leq E\leq1,\\
(-(E+1)^2,(E+1)^2),&E\geq1.
\end{cases}}
$$
The <two-turning-point WKB quantization condition> uses
$$
\boxed{n=0,1,2,\ldots.}
$$

