The <Clebsch-Gordan decomposition> permits
$$
j=|j_1-j_2|,|j_1-j_2|+1,\ldots,j_1+j_2.
$$
Thus a total-angular-momentum singlet $j=0$ occurs exactly when $j_1=j_2$.

